    {{
      `
<span class="dropcap">Ahoy!</span>
I'm Ethan Marks. I'm 16 years old, in my third year of dual-enrollment, and part of [Hack Club](https://hackclub.com). I am script-literate in [Elder Futhark](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elder_Futhark). I use a [Framework 13](https://frame.work/laptop13) with [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org/) and [Zed](https://zed.dev). I'm just writing random factoids about myself to pad the paragraph so that I can see what it looks like with more text on it.
      `
      |> md
    }}
  </section>

  <section id="meta">
    {{
      `
## About this site

This is my personal website. Right now, it's still very very WIP. I'm actively working on it though; the most recent update was
<time class="relativeTime" datetime="${new Date().toISOString()}"></time>.

I've made a couple personal websites before ([v1](https://github.com/ethmarks/ethmarks.github.io) and [v2](https://github.com/ethmarks/personal-site-v2)) with 1,600+ commits between them, but this is my first time using a custom domain (which was a prize from [Tagless YSWS](https://tagless.hackclub.com) :D). Hopefully this one will be better than my previous sites, if for no other reason than because it's built with [Lume](https://lume.land), the objectively best SSG.

In the future, expect an about me page, writeup pages for each of my
projects, probably a blog, and lots of miscellaneous pages.
   	`
      |> md
    }}
  </section>
</main>
